This branch ("proprietary-edition") diverges from the MIT-licensed
`master` branch of this repository specifically to carry a commercial
licensing/entitlement-enforcement layer (see AnimusCore_v1/animus_license.hpp
and BENCHMARKS.md's Phase 17 section). Distributing that enforcement
mechanism under the same MIT terms as `master` would be self-defeating --
MIT already grants unrestricted use, copying, and redistribution, which
would include the enforcement code itself.

No rights are granted under this notice to use, copy, modify, merge,
publish, distribute, sublicense, or sell this software or any portion of
it. All rights are reserved to the copyright holder pending a real,
counsel-reviewed commercial license agreement.

This text was written by an AI coding assistant as a structural
placeholder ONLY, at the copyright holder's explicit request, to keep
this branch's licensing model distinct from `master`'s MIT license
while real commercial license terms are drafted. It is NOT a substitute
for legal advice and MUST NOT be relied upon, distributed to customers,
or treated as binding before a qualified attorney has drafted and
reviewed the actual commercial license terms for this software.
